{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今日", "id": "今日"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "智", "variants": [], "id": "智"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "罪", "id": "罪"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "責", "id": "責"}, {"form": "酒", "id": "酒"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.8965256234705428, "source": "罪", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.7615456906315583, "source": "酒", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 3.3019907315787074, "source": "酒", "target": "好"}, {"weight": 2.608843551018762, "source": "酒", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.309560566888501, "source": "酒", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.8965256234705428, "source": "水", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "水", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.4910605153623786, "source": "水", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.8965256234705428, "source": "水", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.8965256234705428, "source": "今日", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.692552819144607, "source": "今日", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.692552819144607, "source": "事", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.4910605153623786, "source": "事", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "事", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.7979133348024332, "source": "行", "target": "聽"}, {"weight": 0.4986303506721724, "source": "行", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.7979133348024332, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1